  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/maxton/LibOrbisPkg/zipball/v0.2",
  "body": "LibOrbisPkg, PkgTool, and PkgEditor are now pretty stable.\r\n\r\nThis is still beta-quality software, please report any bugs you find by submitting a new Issue on GitHub.\r\n\r\n# Which one should I download?\r\n## I want to build PKGs, edit SFOs, or extract files:\r\n- Download PkgEditor or PkgTool.\r\n  - PkgEditor is a graphical tool, Windows (or Mono) only.\r\n  - PkgTool is a command-line tool suitable for use in homebrew build scripts, etc. Windows, Mac, and Linux builds are available.\r\n\r\n## I want to integrate PKG, SFO, and PFS functionality into a C# app:\r\n- Download LibOrbisPkg",
